    "_comments": [
      "PERSON ENRICHMENT (plans/person-enrichment.md, Phase 3). The scheduled entry point that sends eligible",
      "People to a vendor through an EnrichmentProvider and writes education, employment, LinkedIn and the",
      "vendor identity. Thin: packages/Server/src/custom/enrich-people.action.ts parses params and maps the",
      "result; the engine is @mj-biz-apps/common-enrichment. DriverClass is the ClassFactory key of",
      "@RegisterClass(BaseAction, 'Common.EnrichPeople'); LoadEnrichPeopleAction() keeps it registered.",
      "Never deletes education rows. Admin-only: PersonFilter is SQL.",
      "No sync block: the release push writes that back. primaryKey from uuidgen."
    ],
    "fields": {
      "Name": "Common.EnrichPeople",
      "CategoryID": "@lookup:MJ: Action Categories.Name=Common",
      "Description": "Enrich existing People from a vendor (Apollo, PDL, or a fixture): education, employment, LinkedIn and the vendor's identity. Selects Active people with an email or LinkedIn who have not been checked by this provider within the refresh windows, sends them in batches, and writes with the engine's rules: never edits Manual rows, ends only its own Employee relationships, never creates schools, never deletes education. Preview mode counts and prices a run without calling the vendor.",
      "Type": "Custom",
      "DriverClass": "Common.EnrichPeople",
      "IconClass": "fa-solid fa-user-graduate",
      "UserPrompt": "Enrich people from a vendor.",
      "CodeApprovalStatus": "Approved",
      "Status": "Active"
    },
